@baseUrl = https://localhost:7295
@tenantToken = THAY_BANG_JWT_TENANT
@invoiceId = THAY_BANG_GUID_HOA_DON

### 1. Tenant tạo checkout SePay cho số dư còn lại
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices/{{invoiceId}}/sepay-checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### 2. IPN Gateway mẫu (chỉ chạy khi có chữ ký/secret test hợp lệ)
# SePay gửi X-Secret-Key và JSON body có timestamp, notification_type, order, transaction, customer.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sepay/ipn
X-Secret-Key: THAY_BANG_SEPAY_IPN_SECRET
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "timestamp": 1795600000,
  "notification_type": "ORDER_PAID",
  "order": {
    "order_invoice_number": "SPTHAYBANGMA26KYTU",
    "order_status": "CAPTURED",
    "order_currency": "VND",
    "order_amount": "1500000.00"
  },
  "transaction": {
    "transaction_id": "SEPAY-TEST-TRANSACTION",
    "transaction_status": "APPROVED",
    "transaction_currency": "VND",
    "transaction_amount": "1500000",
    "payment_method": "BANK_TRANSFER"
  }
}

### 3. Bank Webhook mẫu (chỉ chạy khi tạo HMAC đúng raw body)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sepay/bank-webhook
X-SePay-Timestamp: 1795600000
X-SePay-Signature: sha256=THAY_BANG_HMAC_SHA256_HEX
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 92704001,
  "gateway": "Vietcombank",
  "transactionDate": "2026-11-25 11:08:33",
  "accountNumber": "THAY_BANG_SO_TAI_KHOAN_TEST",
  "code": "SPTHAYBANGMA26KYTU",
  "content": "SPTHAYBANGMA26KYTU chuyen tien",
  "transferType": "in",
  "transferAmount": 1500000,
  "referenceCode": "FT-TEST-001"
}
